WEBVTT

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:05.940
Our long, long summer vacation is over!

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:08.650
And... And...

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.900
And!!!

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.900
Oga, you're awake, right?!

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.360
You're not... awake.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.690
What's with you, so bright and early?

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:28.000
What's with me?! Today's 
the start of the new term!

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.050
New term? But the school's still busted up.

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:35.390
Why, you... Didn't you even read it?

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:35.880
Here!

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:41.020
"Notice of transfer"?

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:41.020
<b>Attention all Students
Notice of Transfer
Please go to here, okay?</b>

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:26.000
<b>The New Term Has Started</b>

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.700
But man, what a pain...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.080
Why do we have to go all the 
way to a different school?

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:38.620
Because <i>you</i> destroyed ours! Yeah, you!

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:47.400
Oh... I kinda remember something like that.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:53.510
Well, it's just temporary until they 
repair the school building though.

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:56.110
But don't we have, like, a ton of students?

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:57.460
How's this work?

00:02:57.460 --> 00:03:00.870
That's why they've split us up into 
groups that go to different schools.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:07.120
Now allow me to introduce the 
school which we will be going to!

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:14.750
<b>St. Ishiyama Academy</b>

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:13.720
St. Ishiyama Academy has the highest 
college acceptance rates in the area.

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:15.820
The students there are allowed 
a great deal of independence,

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:18.380
and the academy is known for 
its free and open atmosphere!

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:21.850
The student population is about 
evenly split between boys and girls,

00:03:21.850 --> 00:03:26.620
and there is a cafeteria and 
recreation facilities on campus!

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:28.230
With an abundance of club activities,

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:31.430
everyone celebrates their 
never-to-be-forgotten youth!

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:33.440
The End.

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.190
And there you have it.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:39.190
<b>St. Ishiyama Academy</b>

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:39.190
We're here at St. Ishiyama Academy!

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:41.430
We're here! We're here!

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:45.330
Aren't you a little too hyped up 
for this early in the morning?

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:48.340
And how could I <i>not</i> be hyped up?!

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:51.490
Flown free from those foul delinquents,

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:57.130
when I think of how we'll finally experience 
the oh-so-normal and sweet days of youth...

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.240
Oga, check that out!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.790
I'm so glad I'm alive!

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:18.780
What's wrong?

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:20.980
Um, I think that's a pervert...

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:22.600
You've gotta be kidding me!

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.170
Ew, stay away...

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:30.650
I just transferred here, so I'd 
better make a good impression.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:35.280
Hi! Are you students here at St. Ishiyama...

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:37.020
Uh...

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:41.040
Hey, hurry up and go to the classroom.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.160
Oh, right.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:47.530
Today marks the start 
of our new school lives.

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:51.060
We had better break the ice with 
our new classmates without delay...

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:06.360
<b>Ishiyama High - Special Class</b>

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:04.850
Here?

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:05.730
Looks like it.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.320
Good mor~nin...

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:15.160
U-Um...

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:22.830
W-What is this?

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:27.880
This is odd.

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:30.130
And by that you mean...?

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:34.300
Hm. I do not know much about these 
institutions known as schools,

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:37.550
but they usually separate the 
classes based on year, yes?

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:39.270
Exactly as you say.

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.150
If I recall, Tojo is a third year,

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.080
and Kunieda should be a second year.

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:47.720
Then, is it not strange that they are 
in the same class as Oga, a first year?

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:49.240
Indeed!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.850
Hey... What's the meaning of this, frosh?

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:02.550
Uh, don't ask me!

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:05.100
Huh? Look at me, damn it!

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:09.390
Why do I have to get stuck 
in a class with all of you?

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:11.660
That's my line.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.480
Now, now... Is it really such a problem?

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.350
I don't think this class is so bad at all.

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:24.940
I especially like the seating 
assignment. Don't you, Aoi-chan?

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:28.960
It's not something that's "good" or "bad"...

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:37.060
The teacher decided it, so there's 
nothing we can do about it... It's...

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:44.840
But wait... The TKKH...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.450
Good Night Shimokawa...

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:50.090
Abe the Killing Machine...

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:53.850
Even all the members of the MK5 are here!

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:56.630
This is like, a full set, totally!

00:06:58.690 --> 00:06:59.910
Asswipes!

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:06.940
Enough of this...

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:12.070
It's about time for my 
part-time job, actually...

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:18.810
That's Tojo-senpai for you!

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:22.330
Even in a situation like this, he's 
not shaken a bit! Totally awesome!

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:24.640
You know it's gonna be that...

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:26.850
Our school's full of idiots,

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:30.120
so they don't think it'll be a 
problem to stick us all together.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:31.730
Ain't that right, kid?

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:39.430
Well, I suppose this might spark 
some interesting chaos...

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:41.860
Don't you think so too, lil' buddy?

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.940
Oh... Everyone's doing that.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.730
They don't know how to talk to 
each other without making waves,

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:52.110
so they talk to harmless-looking 
Baby Beel...

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:59.150
I'm sleepy from getting woken 
up early this morning...

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:09.090
Oh, my! Look at him... He sleeps 
with such a innocent face...

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:14.390
There she goes again...

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:36.480
You brats, take your seats and stay quiet.

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:50.510
I'm going to be the homeroom 
teacher for this class...

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:53.450
<b>Sadohara Takumi</b>

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.680
Sadohara.

00:08:57.360 --> 00:09:02.810
I heard you folks are the top-class 
trash at your dump of a high school.

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:08.770
If you think you can carry on here at St. 
Ishiyama the way you did before, you're...

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.520
...seriously mistaken.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.410
What's with this guy?

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.690
Well then, today, we're going...

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:28.660
Let's use him.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:34.750
In the end these guys are just 
a bunch of worthless brutes!

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:38.490
If I whack down the strongest 
one right from the start...

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:41.320
Hey, you there.

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:46.750
Why don't we have a friendly arm wrestling 
match as a way of getting to know each other?

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.670
Do you think you can win?

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.820
Too bad for you...

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:59.200
I might not look it, but when I was in 
school I was undefeated in the arm wrestling club!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:04.120
People called me Golden Arm Sadohara!

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:09.960
Now then... Ready...

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:10.940
Go!

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:14.670
Crap, overdid it.

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:25.200
You... You have some skill there!

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:30.370
Well, my bad then... I guess I 
wasn't feeling so well today...

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:33.780
M-My Golden Arm!

00:10:33.780 --> 00:10:36.650
It hurts! It really, seriously hurts!

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:39.180
But if I show weakness here...

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:43.470
I found me a pushover! {Stool pidgeon means "informant." Another possibility is "straw man."} {pushover is one word.}

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:47.230
For now, I'll make an example 
out of this weakling...

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:50.020
Hey, you over there.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:54.950
What the heck do you think you're 
doing sleeping during class?

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:56.650
Um, Sensei, he's...

00:10:56.650 --> 00:10:58.340
You, be quiet!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.530
You didn't hear me?

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:05.270
What the hell is that baby?

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:07.250
This ain't nursery school!

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:08.320
Yeah...

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:12.310
Don't give me "yeah"! Why don't you 
come with me to the teacher's office?

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:19.570
Now, hurry and wake up!

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:47.570
My name is Yamamura Kazuya.

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:50.910
Right now, I am violently nervous!

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:51.850
That's right...

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:57.360
Because finally, I can 
meet the ones I idolize!

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:02.320
<b>Ishiyama High Special Class</b>

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:03.990
Here?

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:07.200
<b>Warning: Normal Students, Stay Away!</b>

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:12.210
Finally over...

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.480
That guy's the pits.

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:16.210
That's...

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:19.850
Those are the strongest ladies in 
the Kantou region, the Red Tails!

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:22.510
Incredible! The big fish, right off the bat!

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:25.370
What're you doing, Madam Aoi?

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:26.890
Everyone's like, totally leaving!

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:30.790
Even watching from over here, I 
can sense their killer spirit!

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:34.040
Should I get up the courage 
and head over there?

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.020
No, not yet.

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:38.560
Huh? Wait a sec...

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:41.530
I haven't seen the most crucial person yet!

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.190
Hurry up and get out here!

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:44.910
What's up?

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:49.940
Azusa!

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:52.930
What, what? What's going to show up?

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:55.750
Azusa, what are you doing following me?!

00:12:56.990 --> 00:12:59.430
Do you understand what 
kind of a place this is?

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:01.920
You shouldn't be here either, Kazu-kun.

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:06.070
The teacher at morning assembly told 
us it was a bunch of delinquents,

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:07.680
and we should not go near for any reason.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.800
Ah, man! Come with me for a bit!

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:11.870
Hey, wait!

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:16.350
We haven't held hands since 
pre-school, Kazu-kun!

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:17.420
Whatever!

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:24.070
Listen up, Azusa.

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.130
Yes-yes?

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:28.200
I'll tell you the truth since 
we're childhood friends...

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.130
Yes-yes...

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:30.890
Um...

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:35.950
Isn't it embarrassing saying 
"childhood friends" at this point?

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:37.960
Whatever, enough about that!

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:40.330
Uh, so, basically...

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:43.980
Honestly speaking, I look up to delinquents.

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:45.460
Oh, I know that.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:50.520
Kazu-kun, you suddenly dyed your 
hair and got your ear pierced, right?

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:54.990
Everyone was talking about 
your summer vacation debut!

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:57.100
Hey!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:02.390
You idiot, stop followin' me everywhere.

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:05.740
I was thinkin' of observing 
the girls' tennis club.

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.630
And where might you be headed?

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:11.250
I found me a vending machine that sells 
Yogurty, so I'm going to buy some!

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.490
Got a problem with that?

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:13.870
No, no...

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:17.640
Whoa...

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:21.030
If I'm not mistaken, that's Kanzaki 
Hajime and Himekawa Tatsuya!

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:25.680
Getting to see two members of the legendary 
TKKH like this is a real treat!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:28.700
I can sense they're some seriously bad dudes.

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.810
Is that what they call a killer's aura?!

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.980
They're definitely some pretty scary people.

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:37.650
You wanna be like that, Kazu-kun?

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:41.230
Don't be silly. The only one 
in my sights is Oga-san.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:43.330
It's gotta be someone more amazing!

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:44.270
Oga-san?

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:49.740
This ain't good.

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:51.430
A cold?

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:53.530
I thought idiots like 
you can't catch colds.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:56.930
But they say that only 
idiots catch summer colds.

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:58.830
So you agree about the idiot part?

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:03.040
Oh, are you getting hungry?

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.610
Then let's hurry home.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:15.830
Look... That's the legendary Oga-san.

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:19.360
He doesn't seem that scary at all!

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.410
Is that really him?

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:23.110
...I think.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:25.650
He looks like a nice daddy!

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:27.910
And the baby on his back is the cutest!

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:33.760
Indeed... Is that really the 
legendary Oga Tatsumi-san?

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:38.410
Compared to Kanzaki-san and Himekawa-san, 
he's lacking that sort of...

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.390
No, that can't be!

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:43.420
That rumor should be true!

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:47.720
He defeated delinquent after 
delinquent that came at him...

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:50.260
A violent kid who enjoys making 
others grovel before him!

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:54.430
Nicknamed "The Rampaging 
Ogre" and "The BoB Brawler"!

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:58.010
And he's the only first-year 
to ever rise to the top

00:15:58.010 --> 00:16:01.460
of the fierce battlefield 
that is Ishiyama High!

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.830
Yeah... That's right.

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:10.630
If the Baby-on-Board Brawler thing 
is right, so should the rest.

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:13.340
Should be, anyway...

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.640
Right! Anyway, we'll follow them!

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:16.750
Okay, here we go!

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:21.900
It's like we're gumshoes on TV! How fun! {Do people still know what "gumshoe" means? I only know because of an old Firesign Theater sketch. "Detective" maybe?}{Nah, I know what a gumshoe is. It's sorta affectedly cutesy, but I get it...}

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.830
Why don't you try being a little nervous?!

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.410
But...

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:39.350
The one said to be the strongest 
of the TKKH, Tojo Hidetora!

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:41.740
I can't!

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.180
At this rate, Azusa would get involved...

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:45.780
Hey, you there.

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:46.960
Yes?!

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:51.030
Is there a hamburger shop 
around here called Japdonalds?

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.170
I'm starting a part-time job there today.

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:56.600
Oh, it's a little closer to the station.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:58.880
I see. Thanks for your help.

00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:04.280
I thought I was dead meat!

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:06.750
That guy really seemed strong.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.590
Well, duh!

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:11.710
That's Tojo Hidetora, the 
strongest of the TKKH!

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:16.660
But you know, Oga-san even beat that...

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.060
Crap, I lost sight of him!

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.300
Let's hurry after him!

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:22.360
Agreed!

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:34.950
I was just thinking this... But your 
hands have gotten bigger, haven't they?

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:37.460
Who cares about that?

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:40.750
I've got to figure out 
if he's the real Oga-san!

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.330
Where'd he go, damn it?

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:46.870
Here?

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.240
Crap!

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:55.630
We heard the rumors...

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:57.650
You're Ishiyama trash!

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:02.890
And here I went thinking we'd finally 
be able to have peaceful school days...

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:08.650
You're starting to go to that 
St. Ishiyama Academy, right?

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.690
Sorry, buddy.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:12.730
He's getting hungry.

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:13.970
Let us through.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:18.030
Don't go runnin' away all scared!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:22.540
Listen up! This here's 
the turf of Teimo Tech!

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:26.210
You start somethin' around here, 
and you're gonna get hurt!

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:29.830
Owwy...

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:30.850
Sharaku-san!

00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:31.960
You okay?

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:34.500
Yeah, it's a cold...

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.600
I feel like crap.

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:36.840
You do?

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:39.660
No need to double check! He's the real-deal!

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:43.520
I've never seen something like that before...

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:50.020
You bastards! How dare you 
do that to Sharaku-san!

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:52.270
But I told you I was in a hurry.

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:55.440
Let us go!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.400
Be good and stay quiet!

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:58.510
What's that?

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:02.230
Can't you see these?

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:05.700
Uh... Don't ring a bell.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:06.750
Dunno.

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:11.000
Idiots! These are students from St. Ishiyama!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.050
Great going!

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:14.070
Now just try somethin'!

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:19.230
Get normal students mixed up 
in this, and you'll pay for it!

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:20.320
We will?

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:23.010
Sure, I guess?

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:29.180
I knew it... This isn't a world 
where we can set foot in so easily!

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:30.880
Kazu-kun!

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:36.230
Plus, I ended up getting Azusa involved...

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:40.180
At this rate, Azusa will be at the 
mercy of those delinquents...

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:46.040
Damn it... I gotta stop being a failure as 
a man before I even try to be a brawler!

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:48.700
What's wrong, eh?

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.480
Let them go!

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:51.330
Huh?

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:57.630
What the...

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:11.910
And you people need to understand, yes?

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:18.160
From now on, we won't just stand by when you 
lay hands on students from St. Ishiyama, got it?

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:22.200
Kunieda Aoi from the TKKH!

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:24.830
Sheesh...

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:26.390
Now then...

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:30.630
Sorry to have kept you waiting...

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:33.290
Uh... We...

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:40.070
Bu-Bu-Burying Punch!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.520
Looks like my cold's better!

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:54.690
Hey, uh, wait! Hey!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:10.690
Finally calmed down?

00:21:10.690 --> 00:21:13.210
This really isn't something 
you can get used to...

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:14.820
What was that?

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:15.910
Electricity?

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:18.430
But, humans can't do...

00:21:18.430 --> 00:21:19.710
No, wait.

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:26.140
They say electric eels in the Amazon can 
produce as much as an 800 volt shock instantly.

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:28.090
Maybe if a human trains hard enough...

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:30.880
But, how much training would that take?!

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:34.300
Man, you really saved us, Kunieda-senpai.

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:36.680
I'd thought you'd already gone home.

00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:41.190
I-It's just that I was doing some work 
as the class representative, that's all!

00:21:41.190 --> 00:21:43.990
I wasn't thinking about going 
home together or anything!

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:46.820
Well, anyway... Feeding time for Baby Beel.

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:51.230
Hey, at least thank her.

00:21:51.230 --> 00:21:53.230
Sure... Sorry, thanks for that.

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:57.090
It's fine! I didn't help 
because I wanted your thanks!

00:21:57.720 --> 00:22:00.040
He's really cool!

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:02.560
All shocking and stuff!

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:06.260
Please wait!

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:10.600
Oga-san, please listen!

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:13.340
Please accept me as your 
sworn little brother! {Just brainstorming, I get;: Desciple? Be my boss?　Be my godfather? Let me be your underling? Be my mentor? Let me join your gang? Let me be your junior partner? No. Not coming up with anything good.}{hmm... any better ideas for otoutobun?}{apprentice??}

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:14.810
Please!

00:24:02.310 --> 00:24:04.500
It's started right after we transferred...

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:07.090
What'll you do? Those guys from Teimo 
are totally gonna come for revenge.

00:24:07.090 --> 00:24:08.740
In that case we'll just beat 'em up again.

00:24:08.740 --> 00:24:11.220
That's no different than 
when we were at Ishiyama!

00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:13.100
I thought that with a new 
school could finally come

00:24:13.100 --> 00:24:16.090
a chance for a real change, to a pleasant 
school life full of bittersweetness...

00:24:16.090 --> 00:24:19.520
Furuichi-dono, if you want pleasant 
bittersweetness, leave that to me!

00:24:19.520 --> 00:24:22.240
Stay back, you oppressing, salty old man!

00:24:22.240 --> 00:24:23.710
On the next Beelzebub:

00:24:23.710 --> 00:24:25.330
May I Call You Brother?

00:24:25.330 --> 00:24:26.970
You may call me as often as you wish!

00:24:26.970 --> 00:24:27.930
Old fart.

00:24:27.930 --> 00:24:28.580
What?!
